# NOTE: EAS archives from the MONOREPO ROOT (the git root), not from frontend/.
# Patterns are therefore matched against paths like "frontend/ios/Pods/", which
# is why bare "ios/Pods/" or "../backend" entries silently match nothing. Every
# pattern below is written with a leading **/ so it works regardless of which
# directory EAS treats as the archive root.

# Sibling projects - not needed to build the app
**/backend/
**/docs/
**/.claude/
**/.git/
**/cli/

# Dependencies and native build artifacts. Regenerated on the build worker.
**/node_modules/
**/Pods/
**/ios/build/
**/ios/DerivedData/
**/xcuserdata/
**/android/build/
**/android/app/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/.expo/

# IDE
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/

# OS
**/.DS_Store

# Test coverage
**/coverage/
